「月とライン」飾りあり\nツインテールの「毛先も濃いグレー」\n青いベルトの「裏」には数字デザインなし。\n1回内側に入れ込んで外に出して最初の折り込んだベルトの下を通してます。（1本です）\n\nサムネイル使用を検討しているため、耳、しっぽ、髪の毛の先が切れていないと有難いです。\n\n▶︎使用用途\n・収益化済の配信サイト、動画、配信、イベントでの利用\n・各種SNSへの使用、ファンクラブへの掲載\n・ 商用グッズ、イベント頒布グッズ、リアルでの印刷物\n\n難しそうなものがあれば再送させて頂きます。\nよろしくお願い申し上げます。", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 833166, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "Maria", "screen_name": "Maria__1029", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1958112563599958016/AbOMyoFJ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/3156877122/1755685391/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 161}, {"id": 924112, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "めらとん", "screen_name": "melaton_tw", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1348912104602959874/Mu5reue5.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1093100414025687041/1603272154/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 14, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 161}, {"id": 2220695, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "P個体", "screen_name": "peeee_koo", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1651379618270838785/zkWOf2qh.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1551051284215898114/1724567436/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre"